---
title: Igris Inertial Distributed Tracing Flow
---

%% Simplified Distributed Tracing Architecture
flowchart TD
    Client[Client POST /v1/infer] --> API[Igris API Middleware]
    API --> Tracer[Start Trace<br/>Generate TraceID]
    
    %% Inference Flow  
    Tracer --> Router[Route Decision]
    Router --> Decision{Shadow Mode?}
    
    %% Shadow Path
    Decision -->|Yes| Shadow[Shadow Runner + Rust]
    Shadow --> Provider[AI Provider]
    Provider --> Shadow
    Shadow --> Tracer[Add Span Data:<br/>provider model latency cost]
    
    %% Production Path
    Decision -->|No| Provider
    Provider --> Tracer
    
    %% Response & Debug
    Tracer --> Response[Response + X-Trace-ID Header]
    Response --> Client
    
    %% Debug Query
    Client -.-> Debug["GET /v1/metrics/debug"]
    Debug --> Tracer[Return Trace Info:<br/>trace_id span_id attributes]
    Tracer --> Client[Debug Data]
    
    %% Styling
    classDef client fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2
    classDef node fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#7b1fa2
    classDef trace fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00
    classDef decision fill:#e8f5e8,stroke:#388e3c
    classDef provider fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c2185b
    
    class Client client
    class API,Router,Shadow,Response,Debug node
    class Tracer trace
    class Decision decision
    class Provider provider
    class Auth node
